OL,3,GNEWSACost of evacuating subsiding
OL,4,Avillage reaches #1.2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of a major incident that
OL,7,Fforced the evacuation of 97 homes in a
OL,8,Fformer Clackmannanshire mining village
OL,9,Fhas reached almost #1.2m, a new report
OL,10,Fhas revealed.
OL,12,FSome 256 residents in four
OL,13,FCoalsnaughton streets were moved out of
OL,14,Ftheir homes after ground movement was
OL,15,Fdiscovered in May.
OL,17,FThe Clackmannanshire Council report,
OL,18,Fexternal said #750,412 has been spent
OL,19,For committed  by the local authority
OL,20,Fwith a further #425,000 expected to be
OL,21,Fpaid out.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
